<https://uor.foundation/schema/Existential> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Existential quantification (exists)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/schema/pi1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/schema/pi1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/schema/Datum> .
<https://uor.foundation/schema/pi1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "π₁"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/schema/pi1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The unique generator of R_n under successor. Value = 1 at every Witt level. Under iterated application of succ, π₁ generates every element of the ring."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/schema/pi1> <https://uor.foundation/schema/value> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/schema/zero> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/schema/zero> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/schema/Datum> .
<https://uor.foundation/schema/zero> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "zero"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/schema/zero> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The additive identity of the ring. Value = 0 at every Witt level. op:add(x, zero) = x for all x in R_n."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/schema/zero> <https://uor.foundation/schema/value> "0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
