<https://uor.foundation/schema/W8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Witt level 0: 8-bit ring Z/256Z, 256 states. The reference level for all ComputationCertificate proofs in the spec."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/schema/W8> <https://uor.foundation/schema/bitsWidth> "8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
