<https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True iff this identity holds for all n ≥ 1 (proved symbolically by induction on the ring axioms, not just exhaustively at Q0). Identities that reference 8-bit-specific constants receive universallyValid = false."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
