<https://uor.foundation/op/isInvolutory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isInvolutory"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/isInvolutory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether applying this operation twice yields the identity."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
