<https://uor.foundation/op/convergenceGuarantee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "convergenceGuarantee"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/convergenceGuarantee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Description of the convergence guarantee for this operation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
