<https://uor.foundation/op/succ> <https://uor.foundation/op/inverse> <https://uor.foundation/op/pred> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/pred> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/pred> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/UnaryOp> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/pred> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pred"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/pred> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Predecessor: pred(x) = bnot(neg(x)) = (x - 1) mod 2^n. The inverse of succ. pred is the composition bnot ∘ neg."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/pred> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/pred> <https://uor.foundation/op/isRingOp> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
