_:list2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://uor.foundation/op/bnot> .
_:list2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:list3 .
_:list3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://uor.foundation/op/neg> .
