<https://uor.foundation/op/add> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/BinaryOp> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/add> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "add"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/add> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ring addition: add(x, y) = (x + y) mod 2^n. Commutative, associative; identity element is 0."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/add> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/add> <https://uor.foundation/op/isRingOp> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
