<https://uor.foundation/op/add> <https://uor.foundation/op/commutative> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/add> <https://uor.foundation/op/associative> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/add> <https://uor.foundation/op/identity> "0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/add> <https://uor.foundation/op/inverse> <https://uor.foundation/op/sub> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/sub> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/sub> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/BinaryOp> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/sub> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sub"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/sub> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ring subtraction: sub(x, y) = (x - y) mod 2^n. Not commutative, not associative."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/sub> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/sub> <https://uor.foundation/op/isRingOp> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/sub> <https://uor.foundation/op/hasGeometricCharacter> <https://uor.foundation/op/Translation> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/sub> <https://uor.foundation/op/commutative> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/sub> <https://uor.foundation/op/associative> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/mul> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
