<https://uor.foundation/op/mul> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ring multiplication: mul(x, y) = (x × y) mod 2^n. Commutative, associative; identity element is 1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/mul> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/mul> <https://uor.foundation/op/isRingOp> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
