<https://uor.foundation/op/mul> <https://uor.foundation/op/commutative> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/mul> <https://uor.foundation/op/associative> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/mul> <https://uor.foundation/op/identity> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/xor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/xor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/BinaryOp> .
