<https://uor.foundation/op/xor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bitwise exclusive or: xor(x, y) = x ⊕ y. Commutative, associative; identity element is 0."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/xor> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
