<https://uor.foundation/op/and> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/BinaryOp> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/and> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "and"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/and> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bitwise and: and(x, y) = x ∧ y. Commutative, associative."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/and> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
