<https://uor.foundation/op/and> <https://uor.foundation/op/associative> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/or> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/or> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/BinaryOp> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/or> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "or"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/or> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bitwise or: or(x, y) = x ∨ y. Commutative, associative."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/or> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/or> <https://uor.foundation/op/isRingOp> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/or> <https://uor.foundation/op/hasGeometricCharacter> <https://uor.foundation/op/HypercubeJoin> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/or> <https://uor.foundation/op/commutative> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/or> <https://uor.foundation/op/associative> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/dispatch> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/dispatch> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/DispatchOperation> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/dispatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dispatch"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/dispatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "δ(q, R) = R(q): dispatches a query to the matching resolver in the registry. Non-commutative, non-associative."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/dispatch> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/dispatch> <https://uor.foundation/op/hasGeometricCharacter> <https://uor.foundation/op/ConstraintSelection> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/dispatch> <https://uor.foundation/op/commutative> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/dispatch> <https://uor.foundation/op/associative> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/dispatch> <https://uor.foundation/op/operatorSignature> "Query × ResolverRegistry → Resolver"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/infer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/infer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/InferenceOperation> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/infer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "infer"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/infer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ι(s, C) = P(Π(G(s, C))): the φ-pipeline composed into a single inference step. Non-commutative, non-associative."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/infer> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/infer> <https://uor.foundation/op/hasGeometricCharacter> <https://uor.foundation/op/ResolutionTraversal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/infer> <https://uor.foundation/op/commutative> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/infer> <https://uor.foundation/op/associative> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/infer> <https://uor.foundation/op/operatorSignature> "Symbol × Context → ResolvedType"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/accumulate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/accumulate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/AccumulationOperation> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/accumulate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "accumulate"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/accumulate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "α(b, C) = C': accumulates a binding into a resolution context, pinning a site. Non-commutative, associative at convergence (SR_10)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/accumulate> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/accumulate> <https://uor.foundation/op/hasGeometricCharacter> <https://uor.foundation/op/SiteBinding> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/accumulate> <https://uor.foundation/op/commutative> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/accumulate> <https://uor.foundation/op/associative> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/accumulate> <https://uor.foundation/op/operatorSignature> "Binding × Context → Context"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/partition_op> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/partition_op> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/LeasePartitionOperation> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/partition_op> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "partition_op"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/partition_op> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "λ(S, k) = (L₁, …, Lₖ): partitions a shared context into k disjoint leases. Non-commutative, non-associative."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/partition_op> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/partition_op> <https://uor.foundation/op/hasGeometricCharacter> <https://uor.foundation/op/SitePartition> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/partition_op> <https://uor.foundation/op/commutative> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/partition_op> <https://uor.foundation/op/associative> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/partition_op> <https://uor.foundation/op/operatorSignature> "SharedContext × ℕ → ContextLease^k"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/compose_op> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/compose_op> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/SessionCompositionOperation> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/compose_op> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "compose_op"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/compose_op> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "κ(S₁, S₂) = S₁ ∪ S₂: composes two sessions with disjoint leases into one. Commutative, associative (SR_8)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/compose_op> <https://uor.foundation/op/arity> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/compose_op> <https://uor.foundation/op/hasGeometricCharacter> <https://uor.foundation/op/SessionMerge> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/compose_op> <https://uor.foundation/op/commutative> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/compose_op> <https://uor.foundation/op/associative> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/compose_op> <https://uor.foundation/op/operatorSignature> "Session × Session → Session"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/criticalIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/criticalIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/criticalIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Critical Identity"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/criticalIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The foundational theorem of the UOR kernel: neg(bnot(x)) = succ(x) for all x in R_n. This identity links the two involutions (neg and bnot) to the successor operation, making succ derivable from neg and bnot."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/criticalIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_criticalIdentity_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/criticalIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_criticalIdentity_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/criticalIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_criticalIdentity_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/criticalIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/criticalIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/criticalIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AD_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Addressing bijection: addresses(glyph(d)) = d. Round-trip from datum through glyph and back is identity."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_AD_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_AD_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_AD_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AD_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Embedding coherence: glyph(ι(addresses(a))) = ι_addr(a). The addressing diagram commutes through embeddings."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_AD_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_AD_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_AD_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/AD_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R_A1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Additive associativity: add(x, add(y, z)) = add(add(x, y), z)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R_A2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Additive identity: add(x, 0) = x."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R_A3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Additive inverse: add(x, neg(x)) = 0."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R_A4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Additive commutativity: add(x, y) = add(y, x)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R_A5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Subtraction definition: sub(x, y) = add(x, neg(y))."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R_A6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Negation involution: neg(neg(x)) = x."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_A6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_A6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_M1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
