<https://uor.foundation/op/R_M1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R_M1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_M1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Multiplicative associativity: mul(x, mul(y, z)) = mul(mul(x, y), z)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_M1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_M1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_M1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_M1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_M1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_R_M1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/R_M1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
