<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Reducible partition membership: x is reducible iff x is not a unit, exterior, or irreducible."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
