<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DC_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ring derivative: ∂_R f(x) = f(succ(x)) - f(x)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_1_rhs> .
