<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DC_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hamming derivative of identity: ∂_H id(x) = -(2x + 1) mod 2^n."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DC_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Commutator from derivatives: [neg, bnot](x) = ∂_R neg(x) - ∂_H neg(x)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DC_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Carry dependence: the difference ∂_R f - ∂_H f decomposes into carry contributions."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DC_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Jacobian definition: J_k(x) = ∂_R f_k(x) where f_k = site_k."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
