<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DC_7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Top-site anomaly: J_{n-1}(x) may differ from lower sites."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_7_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_7_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_7_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
