<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DC_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Rank-curvature identity: rank(J(x)) = d_H(x, succ(x)) - 1 for generic x."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
