<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DC_9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Total curvature from Jacobian: κ(x) = Σ_k J_k(x)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_9_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_9_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_DC_9_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/DC_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
