<https://uor.foundation/op/phi_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "phi_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/phi_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Observables → Refinement map: observables on a state yield a refinement suggestion."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/phi_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_phi_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/phi_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_phi_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/phi_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_phi_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/phi_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "psi_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ψ_1: Constraints → SimplicialComplex (nerve construction). Maps a set of constraints to its nerve simplicial complex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "psi_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ψ_2: SimplicialComplex → ChainComplex (chain functor). Maps a simplicial complex to its chain complex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "psi_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ψ_3: ChainComplex → HomologyGroups (homology functor). Computes homology groups from a chain complex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "psi_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ψ_5: ChainComplex → CochainComplex (dualization functor). Dualizes a chain complex to obtain a cochain complex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "psi_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ψ_6: CochainComplex → CohomologyGroups (cohomology functor). Computes cohomology groups from a cochain complex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D2n> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D2n> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/DihedralGroup> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D2n> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "D_{2^n}"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D2n> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The dihedral group of order 2^(n+1), generated by neg (ring reflection) and bnot (hypercube reflection). Every element of this group acts as an isometry on the type space 𝒯_n."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D2n> <https://uor.foundation/op/generatedBy> <https://uor.foundation/op/neg> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D2n> <https://uor.foundation/op/generatedBy> <https://uor.foundation/op/bnot> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D2n> <https://uor.foundation/op/presentation> "⟨r, s | r^{2^n} = s² = e, srs = r⁻¹⟩"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/surfaceSymmetry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/surfaceSymmetry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/surfaceSymmetry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Surface Symmetry"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/surfaceSymmetry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Surface Symmetry Theorem: the composite P∘Π∘G is a well-typed morphism iff G and P share the same state:Frame F. When the shared-frame condition holds, the output lands in the type-equivalent neighbourhood of the source symbol."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/surfaceSymmetry> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_surfaceSymmetry_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/surfaceSymmetry> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_surfaceSymmetry_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/surfaceSymmetry> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_surfaceSymmetry_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/surfaceSymmetry> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CC_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Completeness implies O(1) resolution: a CompleteType T satisfies ∀ x ∈ R_n, resolution(x, T) terminates in O(1)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CC_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Completeness is monotone: if T ⊆ T' (T' has more constraints), then completeness(T) implies completeness(T')."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CC_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Witness composition: concat(W₁, W₂) is a valid audit trail iff W₁.sitesClosed + W₂.sitesClosed = n."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CC_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The CompletenessResolver is the unique fixed point of the ψ-pipeline applied to a CompletenessCandidate."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CC_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "CompletenessCertificate soundness: cert.verified = true implies χ(N(C)) = n and for all k: β_k = 0."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QL_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "neg(bnot(x)) = succ(x) holds in Z/(2ⁿ)Z for all n ≥ 1. Universal form of the Critical Identity across all quantum levels."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QL_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The dihedral group D_{2ⁿ} generated by neg and bnot has order 2ⁿ⁺¹ for all n ≥ 1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QL_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The reduction distribution P(j) = 2^{-j} is the Boltzmann distribution at β* = ln 2 for all n ≥ 1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Thermodynamic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QL_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The site budget of a PrimitiveType at quantum level n is exactly n (one site per bit)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QL_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Resolution complexity for a CompleteType is O(1) for all n ≥ 1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QL_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Content addressing is a bijection for all n ≥ 1 (AD_1/AD_2 universality)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QL_7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ψ-pipeline produces a valid ChainComplex for any ConstrainedType at any quantum level n ≥ 1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_7_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_7_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_7_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GR_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Binding monotonicity: freeRank(B_{i+1}) ≤ freeRank(B_i) for all i in a Session."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GR_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Binding soundness: a Binding b is sound iff b.datum resolves under b.constraint in O(1)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GR_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Session convergence: a Session S converges iff there exists i such that freeRank(B_i) = 0."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GR_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Context reset isolation: bindings in C_fresh are independent of bindings in C_prior after a SessionBoundary."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GR_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Contradiction detection: ContradictionBoundary fires iff there exist bindings b, b' with the same address, different datum, under the same constraint."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TS_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Nerve realisability: for any target (χ*, β₀* = 1, β_k* = 0 for k ≥ 1) with χ* ≤ n, there exists a ConstrainedType T over R_n whose constraint nerve realises the target."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TS_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Minimal basis bound: for the IT_7d target (χ* = n, all β* = 0), the MinimalConstraintBasis has size exactly n (one constraint per site position). No redundant constraints exist in the minimal basis."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TS_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Synthesis monotonicity: adding a constraint to a synthesis candidate never decreases the Euler characteristic of the resulting nerve (χ is monotone non-decreasing under constraint addition)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TS_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Synthesis convergence: the TypeSynthesisResolver terminates for any realisable target in at most n constraint additions (for n-site types)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TS_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Synthesis–certification duality: a SynthesizedType T achieves the IT_7d target if and only if the CompletenessResolver certifies T as a CompleteType. The forward ψ-pipeline and the inverse TypeSynthesisResolver are dual computations."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TS_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Jacobian-guided synthesis efficiency: using the Jacobian (DC_10) to select the next constraint reduces the expected number of synthesis steps from O(n²) (uninformed) to O(n log n) (Jacobian-guided)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TS_7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unreachable signatures: a Betti profile with β₀ = 0 is unreachable by any non-empty ConstrainedType — the nerve of a non-empty constraint set is always connected (β₀ ≥ 1)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_7_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_7_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_7_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WLS_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lift unobstructedness criterion: WittLift T' is a CompleteType iff the spectral sequence E_r^{p,q} collapses at E_2 (d_2 = 0 and all higher differentials zero)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WLS_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Obstruction localisation: a non-trivial LiftObstruction is localised to a specific site at bit position n+1. The obstruction class lives in H²(N(C(T))) and is killed by adding one constraint involving the new site."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WLS_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Monotone lifting for trivially obstructed types: if T is a CompleteType at Q_n and its constraint set is closed under the Q_{n+1} extension map, then T' is a CompleteType at Q_{n+1} with basisSize(T') = basisSize(T) + 1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WLS_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Spectral sequence convergence bound: for constraint configurations of homological depth d (H_k(N(C(T))) = 0 for k > d), the spectral sequence converges by page E_{d+2}."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WLS_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Universal identity preservation: every op:universallyValid identity holds in ℤ/(2^{n+1})ℤ with the lifted constraint set. The lift does not invalidate any certified universal identity."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WLS_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ψ-pipeline universality for quantum lifts: the ψ-pipeline produces a valid ChainComplex for any WittLift T' — the chain complex of T' restricts to the chain complex of T on the base nerve, and the extension is well-formed by construction."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WLS_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MN_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Holonomy group containment: HolonomyGroup(T) ≤ D_{2^n} for all ConstrainedTypes T over R_n. The holonomy group is always a subgroup of the full dihedral group."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MN_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Additive flatness (extends OB_H1): if all constraints in T are additive (ResidueConstraint or DepthConstraint type), then HolonomyGroup(T) = {id} — T is a FlatType."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MN_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dihedral generation: if T contains both a neg-related and a bnot-related constraint in a common closed path, then HolonomyGroup(T) = D_{2^n} — T has full dihedral holonomy."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MN_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Holonomy-Betti implication: HolonomyGroup(T) ≠ {id} ⟹ β₁(N(C(T))) ≥ 1. Non-trivial monodromy requires a topological loop. (Converse is false: β₁ ≥ 1 does not imply non-trivial holonomy.)"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MN_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "CompleteType holonomy: a CompleteType (IT_7d: χ = n, all β = 0) has trivial holonomy. IT_7d implies FlatType because IT_7d requires β₁ = 0, which by MN_4 implies trivial monodromy."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MN_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Monodromy composition: if p₁ and p₂ are closed constraint paths, then monodromy(p₁ · p₂) = monodromy(p₁) · monodromy(p₂) in D_{2^n} (group homomorphism from loops to dihedral elements)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MN_7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "TwistedType obstruction class: the monodromy of a TwistedType contributes a non-zero class to H²(N(C(T')); ℤ/2ℤ) where T' is any WittLift of T. TwistedTypes always have non-trivial lift obstructions."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_7_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_7_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_7_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PT_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Product type site additivity: siteBudget(A × B) = siteBudget(A) + siteBudget(B)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PT_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PT_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PT_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PT_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Product type partition product: partition(A × B) = partition(A) ⊗ partition(B). v0.2.2 T1.3: grounds cert:PartitionCertificate — every PartitionCertificate attests the PartitionComponent classification (Irreducible / Reducible / Units / Exterior) derived from this partition-map identity."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PT_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PT_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PT_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PT_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Product type Euler additivity: χ(N(C(A × B))) = χ(N(C(A))) + χ(N(C(B)))."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PT_3_lhs> .
