<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PT_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Product type entropy additivity: S(A × B) = S(A) + S(B)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
