<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ST_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sum type site budget: siteBudget(A + B) = max(siteBudget(A), siteBudget(B))."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
