<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ST_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sum type entropy: S(A + B) = ln 2 + max(S(A), S(B))."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_2_rhs> .
