<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GS_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Context temperature: T_ctx(C) = freeRank(C) × ln 2 / n."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Thermodynamic> .
