<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GS_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Grounding degree: σ(C) = (n − freeRank(C)) / n."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_2_rhs> .
