<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GS_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Grounding monotonicity: σ(B_{i+1}) ≥ σ(B_i) for all i in a Session."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_3_forAll> .
