<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GS_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ground state equivalence: σ(C) = 1 ↔ freeRank(C) = 0 ↔ S(C) = 0 ↔ T_ctx(C) = 0."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Thermodynamic> .
