<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GS_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "O(1) resolution guarantee: freeRank(C) = 0 ∧ q.address ∈ bindings(C) → stepCount(q, C) = 0."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_5_rhs> .
