<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GS_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pre-reduction of effective budget: effectiveBudget(q, C) = max(0, siteBudget(q.type) − |pinnedSites(C) ∩ q.siteSet|)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_6_rhs> .
