<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GS_7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Thermodynamic cooling cost: Cost_saturation(C) = n × k_B T × ln 2."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GS_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GS_7_lhs> .
