<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MS_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Connectivity lower bound: β₀(N(C)) ≥ 1 for all non-empty C."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MS_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MS_1_rhs> .
