<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MS_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Euler capacity ceiling: χ(N(C)) ≤ n for all C at quantum level n."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MS_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MS_2_rhs> .
