<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MS_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Betti monotonicity under addition: χ(N(C + c)) ≥ χ(N(C)) for any constraint c added to C."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MS_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MS_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MS_3_forAll> .
