<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Level-relative achievability: a signature achievable at quantum level n remains achievable at level n+1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MS_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MS_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MS_4_rhs> .
