<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Geodesic condition: a ComputationTrace is a geodesic iff its steps are AR_1-ordered and each step selects the constraint maximising J_k over free sites (DC_10)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
