<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GD_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Geodesic entropy bound: ΔS_step(i) = ln 2 for every step i of a geodesic trace."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Thermodynamic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GD_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Total geodesic cost: Cost_geodesic(T) = freeRank_initial × k_B T ln 2 = TH_4."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Thermodynamic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GD_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Geodesic uniqueness up to step-order equivalence: all geodesics for the same ConstrainedType share stepCount and constraint set."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GD_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Subgeodesic detectability: a trace is sub-geodesic iff ∃ step i where J_k(step_i) < max_{free sites} J_k(state_i)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GD_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QM_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Von Neumann–Landauer bridge: S_vonNeumann(ψ) = Cost_Landauer(collapse(ψ))."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/QuantumThermodynamic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QM_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Measurement as site topology change: projective collapse on a SuperposedSiteState is topologically equivalent to applying a ResidueConstraint that pins the collapsed site."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QM_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Superposition entropy bound: 0 ≤ S_vN(ψ) ≤ ln 2 for any single-site SuperposedSiteState."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/QuantumThermodynamic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QM_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Collapse idempotence: collapse(collapse(ψ)) = collapse(ψ). Measurement on an already-collapsed state is a no-op."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QM_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Amplitude normalization (Born rule): the sum of squared amplitudes equals 1 for any well-formed SuperposedSiteState."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QM_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/QuantumThermodynamic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QM_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/RC_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/RC_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/RC_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RC_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/RC_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Amplitude renormalization: a SuperposedSiteState can always be normalized to satisfy QM_5."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/RC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_RC_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/RC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_RC_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/RC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_RC_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/RC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/SuperpositionDomain> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/RC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/RC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "FPM_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Partition exhaustiveness: the four component cardinalities sum to the ring size."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_FPM_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_FPM_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_FPM_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Enumerative> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "FPM_9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Exterior membership criterion: x is exterior iff x is not in the carrier of T."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_FPM_9_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_FPM_9_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_FPM_9_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/FPM_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MN_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Holonomy classification covering: every ConstrainedType with a computed holonomy group is either flat or twisted, not both."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MN_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MN_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QL_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Witt level chain inverse: wittLevelPredecessor is the left inverse of nextWittLevel."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_QL_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/QL_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "D_7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dihedral composition rule: (rᵃ sᵖ)(rᵇ sᵠ) = r^(a + (-1)ᵖ b mod 2ⁿ) s^(p xor q)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_D_7_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_D_7_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_D_7_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Geometric> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SP_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Classical embedding: superposition resolution of a classical (non-superposed) datum reduces to classical resolution."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_SP_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_SP_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_SP_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/SuperpositionDomain> .
