<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Collapse–resolve commutativity: collapsing then resolving classically equals resolving in superposition then collapsing."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
