<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Amplitude preservation: the SuperpositionResolver preserves the normalized amplitude vector during ψ-pipeline traversal."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_SP_3_lhs> .
