<https://uor.foundation/op/SP_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Born rule outcome probability: the probability of collapsing to site k equals the squared amplitude of that site."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
