<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2a> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2a> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2a> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
