<https://uor.foundation/op/PT_2b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sum type partition coproduct: the partition of a sum type is the coproduct of the variant partitions."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
