<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Geodesic predicate decomposition: a trace is geodesic iff it is both AR_1-ordered and DC_10-selected."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
