<https://uor.foundation/op/GD_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
