<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LiftChain(Q_j, Q_k) is valid CompleteType tower iff every chainStep WittLift has trivial or resolved LiftObstruction."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
