<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WT_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Obstruction count bound: the number of non-trivial LiftObstructions in a chain is at most the chain length."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
