<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WT_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Resolved basis size formula: the basis size at Q_k equals basisSize(Q_j) + chainLength + obstructionResolutionCost."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
