<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_PINS> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_PINS> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_PINS> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_COST_SITE> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_COST_SITE> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_COST_SITE> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CC_COST_SITE"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_COST_SITE> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Carry-constraint cost-to-site count: the number of sites pinned by a CarryConstraint equals popcount plus one for the stopping position."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_COST_SITE> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_COST_SITE_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_COST_SITE> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_COST_SITE_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_COST_SITE> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CC_COST_SITE_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_COST_SITE> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Enumerative> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_COST_SITE> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CC_COST_SITE> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_RR> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_RR> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_RR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jsat_RR"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_RR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "CRT joint satisfiability: two ResidueConstraints are jointly satisfiable iff the gcd of their moduli divides the difference of their residues."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_RR> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_jsat_RR_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_RR> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_jsat_RR_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_RR> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_jsat_RR_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_RR> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_RR> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_RR> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CR> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CR> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jsat_CR"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Carry-residue joint satisfiability: a CarryConstraint and ResidueConstraint are jointly satisfiable iff the carry-pinned sites are compatible with the residue class."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CR> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_jsat_CR_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CR> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_jsat_CR_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CR> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_jsat_CR_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CR> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CR> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CR> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CC> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CC> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CC> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jsat_CC"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CC> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Carry-carry joint satisfiability: two CarryConstraints are jointly satisfiable iff their bit-patterns have no conflicting positions."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CC> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_jsat_CC_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CC> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_jsat_CC_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CC> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_jsat_CC_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CC> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Enumerative> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CC> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/jsat_CC> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "D_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dihedral inverse formula: the inverse of r^a s^p in D_(2^n) is r^(-(−1)^p a mod 2^n) s^p."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_D_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_D_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_D_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "D_9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dihedral reflection order: every reflection element r^k s^1 in D_(2^n) has order 2."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_D_9_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_D_9_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_D_9_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/D_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EXP_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Monotone carrier characterization: a ConstrainedType has an upward-closed carrier iff every ResidueConstraint has residue = modulus - 1 and no CarryConstraint or DepthConstraint appears."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_EXP_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_EXP_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_EXP_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EXP_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Monotone constraint count: the number of expressible monotone ConstrainedTypes at quantum level Q_n is 2^n, corresponding to the principal filter count."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_EXP_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_EXP_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_EXP_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Enumerative> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EXP_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SumType carrier semantics: the carrier of a SumType is the coproduct (disjoint union) of component carriers, not the set-theoretic union."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_EXP_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_EXP_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_EXP_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/EXP_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ST_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SumType Euler characteristic additivity: for a SumType with topologically disjoint component nerves, the Euler characteristic is additive."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ST_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SumType Betti number additivity: for disjoint component nerves, all Betti numbers are additive."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ST_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SumType completeness transfer: a SumType A+B is CompleteType iff both A and B are CompleteType and they have equal quantum levels."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ST_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SumType tag site unique existence: every PartitionCoproduct A + B has exactly one tag site, logically distinct from every data site of A and B, carrying the ln 2 entropy quantum of ST_2."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ST_7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SumType variant tagging: the constraints of a PartitionCoproduct decompose into the operands' constraints plus one tag-pinning constraint per variant (tag = 0 for the left variant, tag = 1 for the right)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_7_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_7_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_7_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ST_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SumType variant nerve disjointness bridge: a PartitionCoproduct constructed via ST_6 + ST_7 + the foundation layout convention produces topologically disjoint component nerves. Bridges the existing conditional ST_3 and ST_4 to PartitionCoproduct constructions concretely."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ST_9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SumType Euler corollary for PartitionCoproduct constructions: combining ST_8's disjointness guarantee with the universal ST_3 yields Euler additivity for any A + B assembled via the PartitionCoproduct construction."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_9_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_9_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_9_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_10> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ST_10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_10> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SumType Betti corollary for PartitionCoproduct constructions: combining ST_8's disjointness guarantee with the universal ST_4 yields Betti additivity at every dimension for any A + B assembled via the PartitionCoproduct construction."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_10_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_10_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_ST_10_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/ST_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CPT_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cartesian partition product site additivity: siteBudget(A ⊠ B) = siteBudget(A) + siteBudget(B). UOR sites are bit widths; |A ⊠ B| = 2^{n_A} · 2^{n_B} = 2^{n_A + n_B}, so sites add even though cardinalities multiply."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_2a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_2a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_2a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CPT_2a"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_2a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cartesian partition product partition map: Π(A ⊠ B) = CartesianPartitionProduct(Π(A), Π(B))."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_2a> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_2a_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_2a> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_2a_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_2a> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_2a_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_2a> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CPT_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cartesian partition product Euler multiplicativity: χ(N(C(A ⊠ B))) = χ(N(C(A))) · χ(N(C(B))). Distinguishes CartesianPartitionProduct (multiplicative χ, Künneth) from PartitionProduct (additive χ, site-disjoint union)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CPT_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cartesian partition product Künneth formula: Betti numbers compose via the Künneth convolution — β_k(A ⊠ B) = Σ_{i+j=k} β_i(A) · β_j(B). Routed through primitive_cartesian_nerve_betti when a CartesianProductShape marker is declared on the combined shape."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CPT_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cartesian partition product entropy additivity: S(A ⊠ B) = S(A) + S(B). Matches PT_4's additive Shannon convention for independent subsystems and is consistent pointwise with IT_7a/b on the combined system (no cross-factor bilinearity required)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Thermodynamic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CPT_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cartesian partition product distributes over PartitionCoproduct: A ⊠ (B + C) ≡ (A ⊠ B) + (A ⊠ C) with equality at the siteBudget, SITE_COUNT, Euler, and entropy levels simultaneously. Does NOT extend to PartitionProduct — distributing ⊠ over × fails at the site-budget level because it duplicates the outer factor."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_CPT_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/CPT_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TS_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Betti-1 minimum constraint count: the minimum number of constraints needed to achieve first Betti number beta_1 = k in the constraint nerve is 2k + 1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TS_9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "TypeSynthesisResolver termination: the resolver terminates in at most 2^n steps for any target signature at quantum level Q_n, returning either a ConstrainedType or a ForbiddenSignature certificate."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_9_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_9_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_9_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_10> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TS_10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_10> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ForbiddenSignature membership criterion: a topological signature is a ForbiddenSignature iff no ConstrainedType with at most n constraints realises it at quantum level Q_n."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_10_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_10_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_TS_10_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/TS_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WT_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ObstructionChain length bound: the length of the ObstructionChain from Q_j to Q_k is at most (k-j) times C(basisSize(Q_j), 3)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WT_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WT_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WT_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WT_9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "TowerCompletenessResolver termination: the resolver terminates for any finite LiftChain within the QT_8 bound, producing a CompleteType certificate or a bounded ObstructionChain."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WT_9_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WT_9_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WT_9_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WT_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/COEFF_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/COEFF_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/COEFF_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "COEFF_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/COEFF_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Standard coefficient ring: the coefficient ring for all psi-pipeline cohomology computations in uor.foundation is Z/2Z, consistent with MN_7."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/COEFF_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_COEFF_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/COEFF_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_COEFF_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/COEFF_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_COEFF_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/COEFF_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/COEFF_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
