<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_10> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GR_10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_10> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ExecutionPolicy confluence: different execution policies on the same pending query set produce the same final resolved state (Church-Rosser for session resolution)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_10_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_10_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_GR_10_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/GR_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MC_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lease partition conserves total budget: the sum of freeRank over all leases equals the SharedContext freeRank."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MC_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Per-lease binding monotonicity: within a leased sub-domain, freeRank decreases monotonically (SR_1 restricted to lease)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MC_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "General composition freeRank via inclusion-exclusion."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MC_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Disjoint-lease composition is additive: the intersection term vanishes when leases are site-disjoint (SR_9)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MC_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Policy-invariant final binding set: different execution policies produce identical SiteBinding records."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MC_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Full lease coverage implies composed saturation: k sessions on disjoint covering leases, each locally converged, produce a GroundedContext via composition."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MC_7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Distributed O(1) resolution: a query against a composed GroundedContext resolves in zero steps."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_7_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_7_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_7_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MC_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Parallelism bound: per-session resolution work is bounded by lease size, not by total site count n."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_MC_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/MC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Witt coordinate identification: the bit coordinates (x_0, …, x_[n−1]) of x ∈ Z/(2ⁿ)Z are exactly its Witt coordinates under the canonical isomorphism W_n(F_2) ≅ Z/(2ⁿ)Z."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Witt sum correction equals carry: the k-th Witt addition polynomial correction term S_k − x_k − y_k (mod 2) is exactly the carry c_k(x,y)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Carry recurrence is the Witt polynomial recurrence: CA_2 implements the ghost equation for S_[k+1] at p=2."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The δ-correction at level k equals the single-level carry c_[k+1](x,y). Each application of δ divides by 2, consuming one unit of 2-adic valuation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LiftObstruction is equivalent to δ-nonvanishing: a nontrivial LiftObstruction at Q_[k+1] means δ_k ≠ 0 for some element pair."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Metric discrepancy equals Witt defect: d_Δ(x,y) > 0 iff the ghost map correction (carry) is nonzero."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Analytical> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "D_1 is the Witt truncation order relation: succ^[2ⁿ](x) = x is the group relation r^[2ⁿ] = 1 in the Witt-Burnside ring of D_[2∞]."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_7_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_7_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_7_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "D_3 is the Witt-Burnside conjugation relation: neg(succ(neg(x))) = pred(x) is srs = r⁻¹ in the pro-dihedral group."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "D_4 is a Witt-Burnside reflection composition: bnot(neg(x)) = pred(x) is the product of two reflections yielding inverse rotation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_9_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_9_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_9_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_10> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_10> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The δ-ring Frobenius lift on W_n(F_2) is the identity map because F_2 is a perfect field of characteristic 2 (a² = a for a ∈ F_2)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_10_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_10_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_10_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_10> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_11> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_11> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_11> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_11> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Verschiebung on W_n(F_2) is multiplication by 2: V(x) = 2x = add(x,x). This is a coordinate shift with zero Witt defect."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_11> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_11_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_11> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_11_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_11> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_11_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_11> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_11> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_11> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_12> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_12> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_12> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WC_12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_12> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The δ-operator on W_n(F_2) is the squaring defect divided by 2: δ(x) = (x − mul(x,x)) / 2. Expressible entirely in existing op/ primitives (sub, mul, arithmetic right shift)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_12> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_12_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_12> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_12_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_12> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_WC_12_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_12> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Algebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_12> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/WC_12> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OA_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ostrowski product formula at p=2: |2|_2 · |2|_∞ = 1. The 2-adic and Archimedean absolute values of 2 are multiplicative inverses."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/ArithmeticValuation> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OA_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Crossing cost equals ln 2: the Archimedean image of one unit of 2-adic valuation, under the product formula, is ln 2 nats."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/ArithmeticValuation> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OA_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "QM_1 grounding: the Landauer cost β* = ln 2 is the crossing cost from OA_2, derived from the prime p=2 that structures the Witt tower."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/ArithmeticValuation> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OA_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Born rule bridge (conditional on amplitude rationality): P(outcome k) = |α_k|_∞², where |·|_∞ is the Archimedean image of the 2-adic amplitude via the product formula."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/ArithmeticValuation> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OA_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Entropy per delta-level equals the crossing cost: each application of the delta-operator (division by 2) costs ln 2 nats in the Archimedean completion, which is the per-bit Landauer cost. v0.2.2 Phase C.4: grounds MultiplicationCertificate."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_OA_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/ArithmeticValuation> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/OA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HT_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "KanComplex(N(C)) — the constraint nerve satisfies the Kan extension condition for all horns of dimension ≤ d where d is the maximum simplex dimension of N(C)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HT_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Path components of nerve recover β₀: π₀(N(C)) ≅ Z^{β₀} counts the connected components of the constraint configuration."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HT_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "MN_6 monodromy is abelianisation of full π₁: the fundamental group π₁(N(C)) surjects onto the HolonomyGroup D_{2^n} via abelianisation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HT_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Higher homotopy groups vanish above nerve dimension: π_k(N(C)) = 0 for all k > dim(N(C)), because the nerve is a finite CW-complex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HT_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "1-truncation determines flat/twisted classification: τ_{≤1}(N(C)) captures the holonomy action that distinguishes FlatType from TwistedType."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HT_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Trivial k-invariants beyond depth d imply spectral collapse: if κ_k is trivial for all k > d then the spectral sequence collapses at E_{d+2}."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_6_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_6_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_6_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_6> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HT_7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Non-trivial Whitehead product implies lift obstruction: [α, β] ≠ 0 in π_{p+q−1} implies a non-trivial LiftObstruction that Betti numbers alone cannot detect."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_7_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_7_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_7_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/IndexTheoretic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HT_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hurewicz isomorphism for first non-vanishing group: π_k(N(C)) ⊗ Z ≅ H_k(N(C); Z) for the smallest k with π_k ≠ 0, linking homotopy invariants to homology."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HT_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Topological> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HT_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "psi_7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ψ_7: KanComplex → PostnikovTower — compute the Postnikov truncations τ_{≤k} for k = 0, 1, …, dim(N(C))."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_7_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_7_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_7_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_7> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "psi_8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ψ_8: PostnikovTower → HomotopyGroups — extract the homotopy groups π_k from each truncation stage."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_8_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_8_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_8_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_8> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "psi_9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ψ_9: HomotopyGroups → KInvariants — compute the k-invariants κ_k classifying the Postnikov tower."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_9_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_9_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_psi_9_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/psi_9> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HP_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pipeline composition: nerve construction + Kan promotion = ψ_7 ∘ ψ_1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
