<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_HP_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/Pipeline> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HP_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Homotopy extraction agrees with homology on k-skeleton."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
