<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HP_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/HP_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "k-invariant computation detects QLS_4 convergence."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
