<https://uor.foundation/op/DD_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PI_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
