<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PA_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Accumulation permutation invariance: accumulating bindings in any order yields the same saturated context (derives from SR_10)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/ComposedAlgebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
