<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PA_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Accumulation monotonicity: α(b,C) ⊇ C (the context only grows, never loses bindings). Derives from SR_1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_2_forAll> .
