<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PA_3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Accumulation soundness: α(b,C) preserves all previously satisfied constraints. Derives from SR_2."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_3_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_3_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_3_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/ComposedAlgebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_3> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PA_4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Accumulation base preservation: α does not modify previously pinned sites."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_4_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_4_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_4_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/ComposedAlgebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_4> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PA_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Accumulation identity: α(∅, C) = C."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_5_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_5_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PA_5_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/ComposedAlgebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PA_5> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PL_1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lease disjointness: partitioned leases have pairwise disjoint site sets (derives from SR_9)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PL_1_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PL_1_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PL_1_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/ComposedAlgebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_1> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PL_2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lease conservation: union of all leases equals the original shared context (derives from MC_1)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/lhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PL_2_lhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/rhs> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PL_2_rhs> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/forAll> <https://uor.foundation/schema/term_PL_2_forAll> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/verificationDomain> <https://uor.foundation/op/ComposedAlgebraic> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/universallyValid> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_2> <https://uor.foundation/op/validityKind> <https://uor.foundation/op/Universal> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/PL_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
