<https://uor.foundation/op/IO_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/IO_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/IO_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "IO_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/op/IO_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Every boundary effect touches at least one site."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
