<https://uor.foundation/resolver/MinFreeCountFirst> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/resolver/MinFreeCountFirst> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/resolver/ExecutionPolicyKind> .
<https://uor.foundation/resolver/MinFreeCountFirst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MinFreeCountFirst"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/resolver/MinFreeCountFirst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Process the query with the smallest targetSite.freeRank first. Favors cheapest resolutions, accelerating early grounding gain."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/resolver/MaxFreeCountFirst> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/resolver/MaxFreeCountFirst> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/resolver/ExecutionPolicyKind> .
