<https://uor.foundation/resolver/MaxFreeCountFirst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Process the query with the largest targetSite.freeRank first. Favors hardest resolutions, maximizing information gain per step."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/resolver/DisjointFirst> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/resolver/DisjointFirst> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/resolver/ExecutionPolicyKind> .
<https://uor.foundation/resolver/DisjointFirst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DisjointFirst"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/resolver/DisjointFirst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Process queries whose targetSite is disjoint from all other pending queries' site sets first. Minimizes contention when operating against a SharedContext."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
