<https://uor.foundation/type/boundObservable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/observable/Observable> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "boundShape"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The predicate form this BoundConstraint imposes on its bound observable. Closed enumeration with exactly six named individuals (EqualBound, LessEqBound, GreaterEqBound, RangeContainBound, ResidueClassBound, AffineEqualBound)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundConstraint> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundShape> .
