<https://uor.foundation/type/conjuncts> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "conjuncts"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/conjuncts> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An ordered list of BoundConstraint individuals that this Conjunction composes. Non-functional — multiple conjuncts span the conjunction."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/conjuncts> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/type/Conjunction> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/conjuncts> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundConstraint> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/verticalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/verticalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/MetricAxis> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/verticalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "verticalAxis"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/verticalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The vertical (ring/additive) metric axis. Constraints on this axis operate through ring arithmetic: residue classes, divisibility, and additive structure."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/horizontalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/horizontalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/MetricAxis> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/horizontalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "horizontalAxis"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/horizontalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The horizontal (Hamming/bitwise) metric axis. Constraints on this axis operate through bitwise structure: carry patterns, bit positions, and Hamming distance."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/diagonalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/diagonalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/MetricAxis> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/diagonalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "diagonalAxis"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/diagonalAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The diagonal (incompatibility) metric axis. Constraints on this axis measure the gap between ring and Hamming metrics — the curvature of UOR geometry."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ScalarType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ScalarType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/PrimitiveType> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ScalarType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ScalarType"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ScalarType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A single value from an ordered domain. siteCount = n (quantization bits)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ScalarType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralSiteCount> "n (quantization bits)"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ScalarType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralGrounding> "quantize(value, range, bits) produces ring element where d_R reflects value proximity"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SymbolType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SymbolType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/PrimitiveType> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SymbolType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SymbolType"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SymbolType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A value from a finite unordered set. siteCount = ceil(log2(|alphabet|))."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SymbolType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralSiteCount> "ceil(log2(|alphabet|))"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SymbolType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralGrounding> "argmin_{encoding} sum d_delta over observed pairs (CY_5)"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SequenceType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SequenceType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/ProductType> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SequenceType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SequenceType"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SequenceType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An ordered list of elements with backbone constraint. The free monoid on the element type."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SequenceType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralSiteCount> "sum of element site counts"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SequenceType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralGrounding> "free monoid on element type, backbone constraint"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SequenceType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralConstraint> "backbone ordering: elements indexed by position"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TupleType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TupleType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/ProductType> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TupleType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TupleType"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TupleType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A fixed collection of named fields."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TupleType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralSiteCount> "sum of field site counts"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TupleType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralGrounding> "site ordering follows CY_6 (optimal site ordering)"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/GraphType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/GraphType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/ConstrainedType> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/GraphType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GraphType"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/GraphType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Nodes with edge constraints. Constraint nerve = graph topology."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/GraphType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralSiteCount> "sum of node site counts + edge overhead"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/GraphType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralGrounding> "constraint nerve = graph nerve, beta_k equality"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/GraphType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralConstraint> "edge constraints: adjacency preserved under grounding"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SetType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SetType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/ConstrainedType> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SetType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SetType"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SetType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unordered collection. d_delta is permutation-invariant."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SetType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralSiteCount> "sum of element site counts"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SetType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralGrounding> "d_delta invariant under element permutation, D_{2n} symmetry"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/SetType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralConstraint> "permutation invariance: encoding is order-independent"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TreeType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TreeType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/ConstrainedType> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TreeType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TreeType"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TreeType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hierarchical structure. beta_1=0 (acyclic), beta_0=1 (connected)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TreeType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralSiteCount> "sum of node site counts"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TreeType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralGrounding> "parent-child encoding with acyclicity constraint"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TreeType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralConstraint> "beta_1=0 (acyclic), beta_0=1 (connected)"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TableType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TableType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/ProductType> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TableType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TableType"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TableType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Collection of tuples sharing a schema = Sequence(Tuple(S)). Functorial decomposition."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TableType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralSiteCount> "row_count * tuple_site_count"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TableType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralGrounding> "Sequence(Tuple(S)), functorial decomposition"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/TableType> <https://uor.foundation/type/structuralConstraint> "shared schema: all rows conform to tuple type S"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Covariant> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Covariant> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/VarianceAnnotation> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Covariant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Covariant"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Covariant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The structural position preserves TypeInclusion: if T₁ ≤ T₂, then F(T₁) ≤ F(T₂)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Covariant> <https://uor.foundation/op/enumVariant> <https://uor.foundation/type/Covariant> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Contravariant> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Contravariant> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/VarianceAnnotation> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Contravariant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Contravariant"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Contravariant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The structural position reverses TypeInclusion: if T₁ ≤ T₂, then F(T₂) ≤ F(T₁)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Contravariant> <https://uor.foundation/op/enumVariant> <https://uor.foundation/type/Contravariant> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Invariant> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Invariant> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/VarianceAnnotation> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Invariant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Invariant"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Invariant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The structural position requires exact type equality: F(T₁) ≤ F(T₂) only if T₁ = T₂."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Invariant> <https://uor.foundation/op/enumVariant> <https://uor.foundation/type/Invariant> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Bivariant> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Bivariant> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/VarianceAnnotation> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Bivariant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bivariant"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Bivariant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The structural position ignores the type parameter: F(T₁) ≤ F(T₂) for all T₁, T₂."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/Bivariant> <https://uor.foundation/op/enumVariant> <https://uor.foundation/type/Bivariant> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/EitherType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/EitherType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/SumType> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/EitherType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EitherType"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/EitherType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The canonical binary disjoint union type whose carrier is L + R."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/OptionType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/OptionType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/SumType> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/OptionType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OptionType"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/OptionType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The canonical A + Unit idiom for optional values."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ResidueDefaultModulus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ResidueDefaultModulus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/ConstraintDefaults> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ResidueDefaultModulus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ResidueDefaultModulus"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ResidueDefaultModulus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Default modulus for ResidueConstraint when the #[uor(residue = X)] attribute omits the explicit modulus. 256 matches the v0.2.1 reference ring Z/(2^8)Z."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ResidueDefaultModulus> <https://uor.foundation/type/defaultValue> "256"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/EqualBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/EqualBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundShape> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/EqualBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EqualBound"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/EqualBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Predicate form: `observable(datum) == target`. Used by BoundConstraint instances asserting strict equality of a datum's observable projection to a target value."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/LessEqBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/LessEqBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundShape> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/LessEqBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LessEqBound"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/LessEqBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Predicate form: `observable(datum) <= bound`. Used by hamming, depth, carry, and site-rank bound constraints."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/GreaterEqBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/GreaterEqBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundShape> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/GreaterEqBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GreaterEqBound"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/GreaterEqBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Predicate form: `observable(datum) >= bound`."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/RangeContainBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/RangeContainBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundShape> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/RangeContainBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RangeContainBound"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/RangeContainBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Predicate form: `lo <= observable(datum) <= hi`. The datum's observable projection must lie within the inclusive range `[lo, hi]`."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ResidueClassBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ResidueClassBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundShape> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ResidueClassBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ResidueClassBound"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/ResidueClassBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Predicate form: `observable(datum) ≡ residue (mod modulus)`. Used by BoundConstraint instances asserting residue-class membership."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/AffineEqualBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/AffineEqualBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundShape> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/AffineEqualBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AffineEqualBound"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/AffineEqualBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Predicate form: `observable(datum) == offset + Σ αᵢ·generatorᵢ`. The datum's observable projection must equal an affine combination of the BoundConstraint's affine generators."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/residueConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/residueConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundConstraint> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/residueConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "residueConstraintKind"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/residueConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Parametric replacement for the v0.2.1 ResidueConstraint class: (observable:ValueModObservable, type:ResidueClassBound). The Rust foundation exposes this kind via the `ResidueConstraint` type alias with `pub const fn new(modulus, residue)`."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/residueConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundObservable> <https://uor.foundation/observable/ValueModObservable> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/residueConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <https://uor.foundation/type/ResidueClassBound> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/residueConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundArguments> "modulus=256;residue=0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/hammingConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/hammingConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundConstraint> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/hammingConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hammingConstraintKind"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/hammingConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Parametric replacement for the v0.2.1 HammingConstraint class: (observable:HammingMetric, type:LessEqBound). The Rust foundation exposes this kind via the `HammingConstraint` type alias with `pub const fn new(bound)`."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/hammingConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundObservable> <https://uor.foundation/observable/HammingMetric> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/hammingConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <https://uor.foundation/type/LessEqBound> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/hammingConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundArguments> "bound=0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/depthConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/depthConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundConstraint> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/depthConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "depthConstraintKind"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/depthConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Parametric replacement for the v0.2.1 DepthConstraint class: (derivation:DerivationDepthObservable, type:LessEqBound)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/depthConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundObservable> <https://uor.foundation/derivation/DerivationDepthObservable> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/depthConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <https://uor.foundation/type/LessEqBound> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/depthConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundArguments> "min_depth=0;max_depth=0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/carryConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/carryConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundConstraint> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/carryConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "carryConstraintKind"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/carryConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Parametric replacement for the v0.2.1 CarryConstraint class: (carry:CarryDepthObservable, type:LessEqBound)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/carryConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundObservable> <https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryDepthObservable> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/carryConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <https://uor.foundation/type/LessEqBound> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/carryConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundArguments> "bound=0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/siteConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/siteConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundConstraint> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/siteConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "siteConstraintKind"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/siteConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Parametric replacement for the v0.2.1 SiteConstraint class: (partition:FreeRankObservable, type:LessEqBound)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/siteConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundObservable> <https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRankObservable> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/siteConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <https://uor.foundation/type/LessEqBound> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/siteConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundArguments> "site_index=0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/affineConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/affineConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/type/BoundConstraint> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/affineConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "affineConstraintKind"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/affineConstraintKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Parametric replacement for the v0.2.1 AffineConstraint class: (observable:ValueModObservable, type:AffineEqualBound)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/affineConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundObservable> <https://uor.foundation/observable/ValueModObservable> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/affineConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundShape> <https://uor.foundation/type/AffineEqualBound> .
<https://uor.foundation/type/affineConstraintKind> <https://uor.foundation/type/boundArguments> "offset=0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UOR Partitions"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Irreducibility partitions produced by type resolution. A partition divides the ring into four disjoint components: Irreducible, Reducible, Units, and Exterior."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/> <https://uor.foundation/space> "bridge"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/schema/> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/type/> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Partition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Partition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Partition"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Partition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A four-component partition of R_n produced by resolving a type declaration. The four components — Irreducible, Reducible, Units, Exterior — are mutually disjoint and exhaustive over the carrier."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Partition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Component"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A single component of a partition: a set of datum values belonging to one of the four categories."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRank> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/IrreducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/IrreducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "IrreducibleSet"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/IrreducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The set of irreducible elements under the active type: elements whose only factorizations involve units or themselves. Analogous to prime elements in a ring."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/IrreducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/IrreducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/ReducibleSet> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/IrreducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/UnitGroup> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/IrreducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Complement> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/ReducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/ReducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReducibleSet"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/ReducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The set of reducible non-unit elements: elements that can be expressed as a product of two or more non-unit elements."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/ReducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/ReducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/IrreducibleSet> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/ReducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/UnitGroup> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/ReducibleSet> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Complement> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/UnitGroup> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/UnitGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UnitGroup"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/UnitGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The set of invertible elements (units) in the carrier: elements with a multiplicative inverse. In Z/(2^n)Z, the units are the odd integers."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/UnitGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/UnitGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/IrreducibleSet> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/UnitGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/ReducibleSet> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/UnitGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Complement> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Complement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Complement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Complement"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Complement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Elements of R_n that fall outside the active carrier — i.e., outside the type's domain. These are ring elements that do not participate in the current type resolution."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Complement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Complement> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/IrreducibleSet> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Complement> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/ReducibleSet> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/Complement> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/UnitGroup> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SiteIndex"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A single site coordinate in the iterated Z/2Z fibration. Each site represents one binary degree of freedom in the ring's structure. The total number of sites equals the quantum level n."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRank> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRank> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRank> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "FreeRank"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRank> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The site budget for a partition: an accounting of how many sites are pinned (determined by constraints) versus free (still available for further refinement). A closed budget means all sites are pinned and the type is fully resolved."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRank> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRank> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRank> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteBinding> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteBinding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SiteBinding"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteBinding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A record of a single site being pinned by a constraint. Links a specific site coordinate to the constraint that determined its value."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteBinding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PartitionProduct"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The tensor product of two partitions: partition(A × B) = partition(A) ⊗ partition(B). The four-component structure combines component-wise under the product type construction (PT_2a). Carries leftFactor and rightFactor links to the operand partitions."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionCoproduct> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/CartesianPartitionProduct> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionCoproduct> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionCoproduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PartitionCoproduct"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionCoproduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The coproduct (disjoint union) of two partitions: partition(A + B) = partition(A) ⊕ partition(B). The four-component structure combines via disjoint union under the sum type construction (PT_2b). Carries leftSummand and rightSummand links to the operand partitions."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionCoproduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionCoproduct> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionProduct> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionCoproduct> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/CartesianPartitionProduct> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/CartesianPartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/CartesianPartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CartesianPartitionProduct"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/CartesianPartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Cartesian product of partitions. Classifies the nerve topology of A ⊠ B as a simplicial product (χ multiplicative per CPT_3, Betti by Künneth per CPT_4) rather than a site-disjoint union (χ additive — PartitionProduct). Site budget is |S_A| + |S_B| per CPT_1 — the bit width of the product state space. Partition-ness is asserted via leftCartesianFactor / rightCartesianFactor (both ranged at Partition), matching the sibling pattern for PartitionProduct and PartitionCoproduct. Satisfies CPT_1–CPT_6 per this amendment."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/CartesianPartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/CartesianPartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionProduct> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/CartesianPartitionProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionCoproduct> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/TagSite> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/TagSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TagSite"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/TagSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The distinguishing site in a PartitionCoproduct whose value (0 or 1) selects the variant. Logically, the tag is not a data site of either operand (ST_6) and carries exactly the ln 2 entropy quantum (ST_2). Its physical placement in a flat constraint layout follows the foundation layout convention: layoutTagSite = max(SITE_COUNT(A), SITE_COUNT(B)), so the tag does not collide with any inherited bookkeeping sites when operands are themselves coproducts."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/TagSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRankObservable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRankObservable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "FreeRankObservable"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRankObservable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Observes the free-rank of the partition associated with a Datum's site context, recording the count of unbound sites at the moment of observation. Used as the bound observable for the siteConstraintKind BoundConstraint."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/FreeRankObservable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/observable/Observable> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionComponent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PartitionComponent"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Closed enumeration of partition component kinds: Irreducible (non-factorizable), Reducible (factorizable into non-trivial parts), Units (invertible), Exterior (outside the factorization domain). Codegen treats this as an enum class with exactly 4 individuals."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/PartitionComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/irreducibles> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/irreducibles> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/irreducibles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "irreducibles"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/irreducibles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The irreducible component of this partition."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/irreducibles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Partition> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/irreducibles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/partition/IrreducibleSet> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/reducibles> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/reducibles> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/reducibles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "reducibles"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/reducibles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The reducible component of this partition."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/reducibles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Partition> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/reducibles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/partition/ReducibleSet> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/units> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/units> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/units> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "units"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/units> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The units component of this partition."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/units> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Partition> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/units> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/partition/UnitGroup> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/exterior> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/exterior> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/exterior> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "exterior"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/exterior> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The exterior component of this partition."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/exterior> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Partition> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/exterior> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Complement> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/member> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/member> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "member"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/member> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A datum value belonging to this partition component."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/member> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/partition/Component> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/member> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/schema/Datum> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/cardinality> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/cardinality> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/partition/cardinality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "cardinality"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
