<https://uor.foundation/observable/rotationExponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The rotation exponent k ∈ \\[0, 2^n) of this dihedral element in the standard representation r^k s^s. Together with reflectionBit, uniquely identifies the element within D_\\{2^n\\}."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/observable/rotationExponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/observable/DihedralElement> .
