<https://uor.foundation/observable/reflectionBit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "reflectionBit"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/observable/reflectionBit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The reflection flag s ∈ \\{0,1\\} of this dihedral element. False = pure rotation (r^k), true = reflection (r^k·s). D_7 defines composition: (r^a s^p)(r^b s^q) = r^(a + (-1)^p b) s^(p XOR q)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/observable/reflectionBit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/observable/DihedralElement> .
<https://uor.foundation/observable/reflectionBit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
