<https://uor.foundation/carry/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Carry chain algebra: generate/propagate/kill event classification, carry profiles, encoding configurations, and encoding quality metrics for d_Δ optimization."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/> <https://uor.foundation/space> "kernel"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/op/> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/observable/> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/partition/> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryChain> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryChain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CarryChain"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryChain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Boolean function chain c_{k+1} = or(and(x_k, y_k), and(xor(x_k, y_k), c_k)). The carry chain is the algebraic mechanism behind the incompatibility metric d_Δ."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryChain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryEvent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CarryEvent"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A single carry event at site k. Three kinds: Generate (and(x_k, y_k) = 1), Propagate (xor(x_k, y_k) = 1 and c_k = 1), Kill (neither generate nor propagate)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryProfile> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CarryProfile"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The complete carry pattern for an addition x + y. Aggregates carry events across all sites into counts and position masks."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/EncodingConfiguration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/EncodingConfiguration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EncodingConfiguration"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/EncodingConfiguration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A mapping from a finite symbol set S to Z/(2^k)Z where 2^k ≥ |S|. Determines how domain values are represented as ring elements."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/EncodingConfiguration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/EncodingQuality> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/EncodingQuality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EncodingQuality"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/EncodingQuality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The d_Δ quality metric for an encoding over observed data. Measures how well an encoding minimizes carry-induced metric incompatibility."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/EncodingQuality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryDepthObservable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryDepthObservable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CarryDepthObservable"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryDepthObservable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Observes the carry depth of a Datum in the W₂ tower, computed as the maximum carry-chain length in any operation producing it. Used as the bound observable for the carryConstraintKind BoundConstraint."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryDepthObservable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/observable/Observable> .
