<https://uor.foundation/carry/chainLength> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The number of sites in this carry chain."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/chainLength> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/carry/CarryChain> .
<https://uor.foundation/carry/chainLength> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
