<https://uor.foundation/carry/propagateMask> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bit mask of site positions where carry propagates: xor(x_k, y_k) = 1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
