<https://uor.foundation/homology/vertex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "vertex"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/vertex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A vertex of this simplex, drawn from the set of constraint objects."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/vertex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/homology/Simplex> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/vertex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/type/Constraint> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/vertexCount> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/vertexCount> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/vertexCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "vertexCount"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/vertexCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The number of vertices in this simplex (dimension + 1)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/vertexCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/homology/Simplex> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/vertexCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/isFaceOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/isFaceOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isFaceOf"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/isFaceOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates that this simplex is a face of another simplex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/isFaceOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/homology/Simplex> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/isFaceOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/homology/Simplex> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/pinIntersection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/pinIntersection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pinIntersection"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/pinIntersection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A site coordinate in the partition whose intersection pins this simplex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/pinIntersection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/homology/Simplex> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/pinIntersection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/hasSimplex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/hasSimplex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasSimplex"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/hasSimplex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A simplex belonging to this simplicial complex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/hasSimplex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/homology/SimplicialComplex> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/hasSimplex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/homology/Simplex> .
