<https://uor.foundation/homology/maxDimension> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "maxDimension"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/maxDimension> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The maximum dimension of any simplex in this simplicial complex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/maxDimension> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/homology/SimplicialComplex> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/maxDimension> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
