<https://uor.foundation/homology/simplicialVertexCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "simplicialVertexCount"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/homology/simplicialVertexCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The total number of vertices (0-simplices) in this simplicial complex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
