<https://uor.foundation/proof/witness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "witness"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/witness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Supporting witness data for this proof."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/witness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/Proof> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/witness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/proof/WitnessData> .
