<https://uor.foundation/proof/criticalIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/criticalIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "criticalIdentity"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/criticalIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Human-readable statement of the critical identity proven. E.g., 'neg(bnot(x)) = succ(x) for all x in R_n'. Annotation only — proof:provesIdentity is the typed reference."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/criticalIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/CriticalIdentityProof> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/criticalIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/x> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A specific input value used as a witness for the critical identity check."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/WitnessData> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
