<https://uor.foundation/proof/bnot_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "bnot_x"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/bnot_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The value bnot(x) for a witness x."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/bnot_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/WitnessData> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/bnot_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
