<https://uor.foundation/proof/neg_bnot_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "neg_bnot_x"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/neg_bnot_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The value neg(bnot(x)) for a witness x."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/neg_bnot_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/WitnessData> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/neg_bnot_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/succ_x> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/succ_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "succ_x"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/succ_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The value succ(x) for a witness x."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/succ_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/WitnessData> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/succ_x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/holds> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/holds> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "holds"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/holds> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether the identity neg(bnot(x)) = succ(x) holds for this specific witness."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/holds> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/WitnessData> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/holds> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "provesIdentity"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The algebraic identity this proof establishes. Provides a canonical object reference alongside the existing proof:criticalIdentity string property, which remains for human readability."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/Proof> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/op/Identity> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/atWittLevel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/atWittLevel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/atWittLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "atWittLevel"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/atWittLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The quantum level at which this computation certificate was produced. A ComputationCertificate at schema:Q0 confirms the identity holds for all 256 inputs of R_8. A certificate at schema:Q1 confirms it for all 65,536 inputs of R_16."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/atWittLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/ComputationCertificate> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/atWittLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/schema/WittLevel> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/wittNote> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/wittNote> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/wittNote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "wittNote"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/wittNote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Human-readable quantum level note, e.g. 'n=8, 256 inputs'. Annotation only — proof:atWittLevel is the typed assertion."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/wittNote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/ComputationCertificate> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/wittNote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/universalScope> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/universalScope> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/universalScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "universalScope"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/universalScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True when this axiomatic derivation holds for all quantum levels by the definition of Z/(2^n)Z. False when the derivation depends on a property specific to a particular ring size. All current AxiomaticDerivation individuals in the spec carry universalScope true."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/universalScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/AxiomaticDerivation> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/universalScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
