<https://uor.foundation/proof/derivationWitness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "derivationWitness"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/derivationWitness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The derivation chain that witnesses this axiomatic derivation. Links a proof:AxiomaticDerivation to the derivation:Derivation individual recording the rewrite sequence. Optional at the spec level — the conformance suite requires only that the proof individual exists; full derivation chains live in generated artifacts."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/derivationWitness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/proof/AxiomaticDerivation> .
