<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of synthesis monotonicity: adding a constraint never decreases the Euler characteristic of the constraint nerve. Follows from the nerve inclusion principle."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_3> <https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/TS_3> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_3> <https://uor.foundation/proof/universalScope> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_3> <https://uor.foundation/proof/verified> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
