<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of synthesis convergence: the TypeSynthesisResolver terminates in at most n steps. Follows from monotonicity (TS_3) and the finite site budget bound."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_4> <https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/TS_4> .
