<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of synthesis-certification duality: a SynthesizedType achieves IT_7d iff the CompletenessResolver certifies it as CompleteType. The duality follows from the shared topological criterion."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_5> <https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/TS_5> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_5> <https://uor.foundation/proof/universalScope> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
