<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of Jacobian-guided synthesis efficiency: the Jacobian oracle reduces expected steps from O(n²) to O(n log n). Follows from the information content of the Jacobian at each synthesis step."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_6> <https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/TS_6> .
