<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_TS_7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of unreachable signatures: β₀ = 0 is unreachable by any non-empty ConstrainedType. Follows from the nerve connectedness of non-empty constraint sets."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
