<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of lift unobstructedness criterion: WittLift T' is CompleteType iff the spectral sequence collapses at E_2. Follows from the Leray spectral sequence of the quantum level extension."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
