<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of obstruction localisation: a non-trivial LiftObstruction is localised to a specific site at bit position n+1. Follows from the local-to-global structure of the constraint nerve."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_2> <https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_2> .
