<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of monotone lifting: basisSize(T') = basisSize(T) + 1 for trivially obstructed lifts. Follows from the minimal basis construction at Q_{n+1}."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_3> <https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_3> .
