<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of spectral sequence convergence bound: the spectral sequence converges by page E_{d+2} for depth-d configurations. Follows from the filtration length of the constraint nerve chain complex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_4> <https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_4> .
