<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of universal identity preservation under quantum lifts: every universallyValid identity holds in the lifted ring. Follows from the universal validity definition and ring extension properties."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_5> <https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_5> .
