<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "prf_WLS_6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of ψ-pipeline universality for quantum lifts: the ψ-pipeline produces a valid ChainComplex for any WittLift. Follows from the functorial construction of the chain complex."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_6> <https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/WLS_6> .
