<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_1_base> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Base case for QLS_1 at Q0: lift unobstructedness holds trivially for 8-bit rings where the constraint nerve is contractible."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
