<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_2_base> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Base case for QLS_2 at Q0: obstruction localisation holds at the 8-bit level where sites are directly inspectable."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
