<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_2_base> <https://uor.foundation/proof/universalScope> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_WLS_2_base> <https://uor.foundation/proof/verified> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
