<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_ST_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of ST_3: Euler characteristic additivity for disjoint simplicial complexes."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
