<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_ST_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of ST_4: Betti number additivity via Mayer-Vietoris for disjoint union."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
