<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_ST_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/proof/AxiomaticDerivation> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_ST_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "prf_ST_5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_ST_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of ST_5: SumType completeness transfer follows from ST_3 + ST_4 + IT_7d."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_ST_5> <https://uor.foundation/proof/provesIdentity> <https://uor.foundation/op/ST_5> .
