<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_CPT_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of CPT_5: entropy additivity for Cartesian partition products. S(A ⊠ B) = S(A) + S(B) — Shannon additivity for independent subsystems. Consistent pointwise with IT_7a/b on the combined system."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
