<https://uor.foundation/proof/prf_CPT_6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of CPT_6: distributivity of Cartesian partition product over PartitionCoproduct. A ⊠ (B + C) ≡ (A ⊠ B) + (A ⊠ C) at the siteBudget, SITE_COUNT, χ, and entropy levels simultaneously. Does NOT extend to PartitionProduct (distribution over × duplicates the outer factor at the site-budget level)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
