<https://uor.foundation/derivation/step> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "step"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/step> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A rewrite step in this derivation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/step> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/derivation/Derivation> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/step> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/derivation/RewriteStep> .
