<https://uor.foundation/derivation/termMetrics> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/termMetrics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "termMetrics"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/termMetrics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Metrics for the canonical term produced by this derivation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/termMetrics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/derivation/Derivation> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/termMetrics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/derivation/TermMetrics> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/from> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/from> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
