<https://uor.foundation/derivation/from> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The term before this rewrite step."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/from> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/derivation/RewriteStep> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/from> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/schema/Term> .
