<https://uor.foundation/derivation/to> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The term after this rewrite step."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/derivation/to> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/derivation/RewriteStep> .
