<https://uor.foundation/derivation/hasRewriteRule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The typed rewrite rule applied in this step. Provides a structured reference to a named RewriteRule individual, complementing the string-valued derivation:rule property."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
