<https://uor.foundation/trace/isGeodesic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/trace/ComputationTrace> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isGeodesic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
