<https://uor.foundation/trace/geodesicViolation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "geodesicViolation"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/geodesicViolation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A GeodesicViolation record indicating where the trace deviated from the geodesic condition."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/geodesicViolation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/trace/ComputationTrace> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/geodesicViolation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/trace/GeodesicViolation> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/stepEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/stepEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/stepEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "stepEntropyCost"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/stepEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The entropy cost of a single computation step. On a geodesic, this equals ln 2 for every step (GD_2)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/stepEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/trace/ComputationStep> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/stepEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/cumulativeEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/cumulativeEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/cumulativeEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "cumulativeEntropyCost"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/cumulativeEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The total entropy cost accumulated across all steps of a trace. On a geodesic, equals freeRank_initial × ln 2 (GD_3)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/cumulativeEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/trace/ComputationTrace> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/cumulativeEntropyCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/jacobianAtStep> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/jacobianAtStep> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/jacobianAtStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jacobianAtStep"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/jacobianAtStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Jacobian value J_k at this step, used by the GeodesicValidator to check DC_10 maximality."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/jacobianAtStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/trace/ComputationStep> .
