<https://uor.foundation/trace/adiabaticallyOrdered> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether the step sequence of this trace follows the AR_1 adiabatic ordering (decreasing freeRank × cost-per-site)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/adiabaticallyOrdered> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/trace/ComputationTrace> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/adiabaticallyOrdered> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/violationReason> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/violationReason> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
