<https://uor.foundation/trace/preCollapseEntropy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The von Neumann entropy S_vN of the SuperposedSiteState before projective collapse."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
