<https://uor.foundation/trace/collapseStep> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/collapseStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "collapseStep"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/collapseStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The step index within the enclosing ComputationTrace at which this projective collapse occurred."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
