<https://uor.foundation/trace/amplitudeVector> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/amplitudeVector> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "amplitudeVector"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/amplitudeVector> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The full pre-collapse amplitude vector of all branches at the time of measurement. Enables Born rule verification (QM_5): P(outcome k) = |α_k|² / Σ|αᵢ|²."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
