<https://uor.foundation/trace/amplitudeVector> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isAR1Ordered> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isAR1Ordered> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isAR1Ordered> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isAR1Ordered"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isAR1Ordered> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether this computation trace has steps ordered by the AR_1 adiabatic metric (decreasing freeRank × cost-per-site). One of the two sub-predicates of isGeodesic (GD_6)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isAR1Ordered> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/trace/ComputationTrace> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isAR1Ordered> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isDC10Selected> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isDC10Selected> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isDC10Selected> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isDC10Selected"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isDC10Selected> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether each step of this computation trace was selected by the DC_10 Jacobian criterion (maximal J_k among free sites). One of the two sub-predicates of isGeodesic (GD_6)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isDC10Selected> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/trace/ComputationTrace> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/isDC10Selected> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/outcomeValue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/outcomeValue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/outcomeValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "outcomeValue"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/outcomeValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The classical site index selected by projective collapse in this measurement outcome."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
