<https://uor.foundation/trace/outcomeValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/outcomeProbability> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/outcomeProbability> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/outcomeProbability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "outcomeProbability"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/outcomeProbability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Born-rule probability of this measurement outcome: |α_k|² where α_k is the amplitude of the collapsed site."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
