<https://uor.foundation/trace/checkpoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "checkpoint"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/trace/checkpoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Checkpoints crossed by the inhabitance search. Each checkpoint marks an audit point where the resolver state can be restored if the search backtracks."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
