<https://uor.foundation/morphism/sourceQuantum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The quantum level n of the source ring for an embedding."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/sourceQuantum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/morphism/Embedding> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/sourceQuantum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/targetQuantum> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/targetQuantum> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/targetQuantum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "targetQuantum"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/targetQuantum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The quantum level n' of the target ring for an embedding. Must satisfy n' > n (embeddings go to larger rings)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/targetQuantum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/morphism/Embedding> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/targetQuantum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger> .
