<https://uor.foundation/morphism/actionIsometry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/morphism/Action> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/actionIsometry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/trace> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
