<https://uor.foundation/morphism/trace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "trace"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/trace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The computation trace that realized this transform at runtime. A Transform is an abstraction; a trace is the kernel's record of how it was executed via concrete operations."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/trace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/morphism/Transform> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/trace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/trace/ComputationTrace> .
