<https://uor.foundation/morphism/composesWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A transform that this transform can be composed with. The target of this transform must match the source of the composed transform."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
