<https://uor.foundation/morphism/identityOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The type on which this identity transform acts."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/identityOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/morphism/Identity> .
