<https://uor.foundation/morphism/compositionOrder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The number of component transforms in a composition."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/compositionOrder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
