<https://uor.foundation/morphism/Utf8GroundingMap> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Grounds UTF-8 host strings to ring addresses."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/morphism/Utf8GroundingMap> <https://uor.foundation/morphism/inputClass> <https://uor.foundation/schema/HostStringLiteral> .
