<https://uor.foundation/state/ConvergenceBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ConvergenceBoundary"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ConvergenceBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The session resolver determined that no further queries can reduce the aggregate site deficit."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ContradictionBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ContradictionBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/state/SessionBoundaryType> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ContradictionBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ContradictionBoundary"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ContradictionBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A new query produced a type contradiction with an accumulated binding. Context must reset before resolution can continue."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/Open> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/Open> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/state/GroundingPhase> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/Open> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Open"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/Open> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The context has σ = 0: no bindings accumulated, all sites are free. The initial phase of every session."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/PartialGrounding> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/PartialGrounding> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/state/GroundingPhase> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/PartialGrounding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PartialGrounding"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/PartialGrounding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The context has 0 < σ < 1: some sites are pinned by accumulated bindings, but free sites remain. The accumulation phase."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/FullGrounding> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/FullGrounding> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/state/GroundingPhase> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/FullGrounding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "FullGrounding"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/FullGrounding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The context has σ = 1: all sites are pinned, freeRank = 0. The ground state. All subsequent queries resolve in O(1) via SC_5."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ground_state> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ground_state> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/state/GroundedContext> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ground_state> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ground_state"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ground_state> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The canonical ground-state witness: a GroundedContext at σ = 1, freeRank = 0, T_ctx = 0, S = 0 (SC_4). Demonstrates that full saturation is achievable and O(1) resolution (SC_5) is realized."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ground_state> <https://uor.foundation/state/groundingDegree> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ground_state> <https://uor.foundation/state/contextTemperature> "0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ground_state> <https://uor.foundation/state/isGrounded> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ground_state> <https://uor.foundation/state/residualFreeCount> "0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://uor.foundation/state/ground_state> <https://uor.foundation/state/groundingPhase> <https://uor.foundation/state/FullGrounding> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UOR Euler Reduction"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sequential composition of the foundation's nine inter-algebra maps into a parameterized reduction pipeline. Defines stages, phase gates, rollback, and epochs."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <https://uor.foundation/space> "kernel"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/op/> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/state/> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/partition/> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/resolver/> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/morphism/> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/observable/> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/predicate/> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/effect/> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/schema/> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/u/> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/EulerReduction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/EulerReduction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EulerReduction"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/EulerReduction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The composite endofunctor ψ = ψ_9 ∘ … ∘ ψ_1, parameterized by Ω = e^{iπ/6}."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/EulerReduction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PhaseRotationScheduler> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PhaseRotationScheduler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PhaseRotationScheduler"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PhaseRotationScheduler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Schedule Ω⁰, Ω¹, …, Ω⁵ assigning a phase angle to each stage of the reduction."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PhaseRotationScheduler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/TargetConvergenceAngle> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/TargetConvergenceAngle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TargetConvergenceAngle"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/TargetConvergenceAngle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The angle at which the reduction terminates (default: π)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/TargetConvergenceAngle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PhaseGateAttestation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PhaseGateAttestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PhaseGateAttestation"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PhaseGateAttestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Validation at each stage boundary checking that the accumulated phase angle matches the expected Ω^k."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PhaseGateAttestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ComplexConjugateRollback> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ComplexConjugateRollback> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ComplexConjugateRollback"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ComplexConjugateRollback> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Recovery operation when a phase gate fails: z → z̄. Involutory: applying twice yields the original value."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ComplexConjugateRollback> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionStep> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReductionStep"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A named stage of the reduction. The standard reduction has six stages (Initialization through Convergence)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionState> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReductionState"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "State of reduction execution at a specific point, including the current stage, phase angle, and pinned mask."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionRule> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionRule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReductionRule"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionRule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Guard-effect pair governing stage transitions in the reduction. The guard must be satisfied before the effect is applied."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionRule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/Epoch> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/Epoch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Epoch"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/Epoch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Temporal segment of reduction execution. Each epoch represents one complete pass through the reduction stages."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/Epoch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/EpochBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/EpochBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EpochBoundary"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/EpochBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Transition between epochs. Carries metadata about the epoch boundary crossing."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/EpochBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PredicateExpression> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PredicateExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PredicateExpression"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PredicateExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Boolean expression over the reduction state. The atomic guard unit."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PredicateExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/GuardExpression> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/GuardExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GuardExpression"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/GuardExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A conjunction of PredicateExpressions that must hold for a transition to fire."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/GuardExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/TransitionEffect> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/TransitionEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TransitionEffect"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/TransitionEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "State changes applied when a transition fires. Contains PropertyBind steps."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/TransitionEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PropertyBind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PropertyBind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PropertyBind"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PropertyBind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A single site pinning: target site + value."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PropertyBind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionAdvance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionAdvance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReductionAdvance"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionAdvance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Advancement from one ReductionStep to the next."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionAdvance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ServiceWindow> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ServiceWindow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ServiceWindow"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ServiceWindow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A sliding window over recent epochs providing BaseContext."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ServiceWindow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionTransaction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionTransaction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReductionTransaction"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionTransaction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An atomic group of state changes within the reduction."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/ReductionTransaction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PipelineSuccess> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PipelineSuccess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PipelineSuccess"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PipelineSuccess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Successful termination (FullGrounding)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PipelineSuccess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PipelineFailureReason> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PipelineFailureReason> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PipelineFailureReason"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PipelineFailureReason> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Typed failure: DispatchMiss, GroundingFailure, ConvergenceStall, etc."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PipelineFailureReason> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PreflightCheck> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PreflightCheck> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PreflightCheck"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PreflightCheck> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A pre-execution validation: feasibility, dispatch coverage, coherence."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/PreflightCheck> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/FeasibilityResult> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/FeasibilityResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "FeasibilityResult"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/FeasibilityResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Result of a preflight check: feasibility witness or infeasibility witness."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/FeasibilityResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/LeaseState> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/reduction/LeaseState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LeaseState"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
