<https://uor.foundation/convergence/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hopf convergence tower: four levels R, C, H, O corresponding to the four normed division algebras of dimensions 1, 2, 4, 8. Each level carries a Hopf fibration fiber and Betti signature."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/convergence/> <https://uor.foundation/space> "kernel"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
