<https://uor.foundation/division/algebraDimension> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The dimension of this division algebra (1, 2, 4, or 8)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/algebraDimension> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/division/NormedDivisionAlgebra> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/algebraDimension> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
