<https://uor.foundation/division/isCommutative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isCommutative"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/isCommutative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether multiplication in this algebra is commutative."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/isCommutative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/division/NormedDivisionAlgebra> .
