<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_R_to_C> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_R_to_C> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/division/CayleyDicksonConstruction> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_R_to_C> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "cayleyDickson_R_to_C"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_R_to_C> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cayley-Dickson doubling R → C: adjoin i with i² = −1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_R_to_C> <https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDicksonSource> <https://uor.foundation/division/RealAlgebra> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_R_to_C> <https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDicksonTarget> <https://uor.foundation/division/ComplexAlgebra> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_R_to_C> <https://uor.foundation/division/adjoinedElement> "i"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_R_to_C> <https://uor.foundation/division/conjugationRule> "i² = −1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_C_to_H> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_C_to_H> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/division/CayleyDicksonConstruction> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_C_to_H> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "cayleyDickson_C_to_H"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_C_to_H> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cayley-Dickson doubling C → H: adjoin j with j² = −1, ij = k, ji = −k."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_C_to_H> <https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDicksonSource> <https://uor.foundation/division/ComplexAlgebra> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_C_to_H> <https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDicksonTarget> <https://uor.foundation/division/QuaternionAlgebra> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_C_to_H> <https://uor.foundation/division/adjoinedElement> "j"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_C_to_H> <https://uor.foundation/division/conjugationRule> "ij = k, ji = −k"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_H_to_O> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_H_to_O> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/division/CayleyDicksonConstruction> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_H_to_O> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "cayleyDickson_H_to_O"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_H_to_O> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cayley-Dickson doubling H → O: adjoin l, non-associative Fano plane products."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_H_to_O> <https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDicksonSource> <https://uor.foundation/division/QuaternionAlgebra> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_H_to_O> <https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDicksonTarget> <https://uor.foundation/division/OctonionAlgebra> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_H_to_O> <https://uor.foundation/division/adjoinedElement> "l"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/division/cayleyDickson_H_to_O> <https://uor.foundation/division/conjugationRule> "non-associative Fano plane products"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
