<https://uor.foundation/interaction/InteractionContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Two entities sharing sites through composed operations. Properties: entityA, entityB, sharedSiteMask, commutatorNorm."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/interaction/InteractionContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
