<https://uor.foundation/interaction/CommutatorState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The norm ‖[δ_A, ι_B]‖ on shared sites. Zero iff operators commute on the shared domain."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/interaction/CommutatorState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
