<https://uor.foundation/interaction/AssociatorState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The norm of the three-way associator on shared sites."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/interaction/AssociatorState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/interaction/AssociatorTriple> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
