<https://uor.foundation/effect/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UOR Effect Algebra"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Typed endomorphisms on state:Context classified by site target. Formalizes what reduction guard-effect pairs do to the site budget."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/> <https://uor.foundation/space> "kernel"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/op/> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/state/> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/partition/> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/type/> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/cert/> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/Effect> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/Effect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Effect"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/Effect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A typed endomorphism on state:Context. Maps one site-budget configuration to another. The atomic unit of state mutation in the kernel."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/Effect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/ReversibleEffect> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/ReversibleEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReversibleEffect"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/ReversibleEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An effect that has a well-defined inverse. PinningEffect and PhaseEffect are reversible; ExternalEffect and CompositeEffect are not in general."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/ReversibleEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/effect/Effect> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/PinningEffect> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/PinningEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PinningEffect"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/PinningEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pins a single free site to a definite value. Decrements freeRank by exactly 1. The effect produced by constraint resolution."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/PinningEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/effect/ReversibleEffect> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/UnbindingEffect> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/UnbindingEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UnbindingEffect"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/UnbindingEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Releases a pinned site back to free state. Increments freeRank by exactly 1. The effect produced by session boundary reset."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/UnbindingEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/effect/Effect> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/PhaseEffect> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/PhaseEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PhaseEffect"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/PhaseEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Rotates the reduction phase angle by Ω^k. Does not alter the site budget. The effect produced by reduction step transitions."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/PhaseEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/effect/ReversibleEffect> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/CompositeEffect> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/CompositeEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CompositeEffect"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/CompositeEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An ordered sequence of effects applied atomically. The composition E₁ ; E₂ applies E₁ then E₂."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/CompositeEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/effect/Effect> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/ExternalEffect> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/ExternalEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ExternalEffect"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/ExternalEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An opaque effect declared by a Prism implementation. The kernel treats it as a site-budget transformation satisfying the declared commutation contract. Must carry an effect:externalEffectShape linking to a conformance:EffectShape."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/ExternalEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/effect/Effect> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/EffectTarget> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/EffectTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EffectTarget"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/EffectTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The set of site coordinates that an effect reads or writes. Determines commutation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/EffectTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/DisjointnessWitness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/DisjointnessWitness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DisjointnessWitness"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/DisjointnessWitness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A certificate that two EffectTargets have empty intersection, enabling commutative reordering."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/DisjointnessWitness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
