<https://uor.foundation/effect/effectTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The site coordinates this effect touches."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/effectTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/effect/Effect> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/effectTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/effect/EffectTarget> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/targetSites> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
