<https://uor.foundation/effect/targetSites> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The individual site coordinates in this target set."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/targetSites> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/effect/EffectTarget> .
<https://uor.foundation/effect/targetSites> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> .
