<https://uor.foundation/predicate/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UOR Predicates and Dispatch"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Boolean-valued functions on kernel objects. Formalizes resolver dispatch, reduction guard evaluation, and conditional resolution paths."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/> <https://uor.foundation/space> "kernel"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
