<https://uor.foundation/predicate/Predicate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A total, pure, boolean-valued function on a kernel object. Evaluation terminates for all inputs and produces no side effects."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/Predicate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/TypePredicate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/TypePredicate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TypePredicate"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/TypePredicate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A predicate over type:TypeDefinition. Used for resolver dispatch."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/TypePredicate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/predicate/Predicate> .
