<https://uor.foundation/predicate/StatePredicate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A predicate over state:Context or reduction:ReductionState. Used for reduction step guards."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/StatePredicate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/predicate/Predicate> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/SitePredicate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
