<https://uor.foundation/predicate/SitePredicate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A predicate over partition:SiteIndex. Used for site-level selection in geodesic resolution."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/SitePredicate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/predicate/Predicate> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/DispatchRule> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/DispatchRule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DispatchRule"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/DispatchRule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A pair (Predicate, Target) where Target is a resolver:Resolver class. The kernel evaluates the predicate; if true, the target resolver is selected."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/DispatchRule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
