<https://uor.foundation/predicate/DispatchTable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An ordered set of DispatchRules for a single dispatch point. Must satisfy exhaustiveness and mutual exclusion."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/DispatchTable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/GuardedTransition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/GuardedTransition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GuardedTransition"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/GuardedTransition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A triple (StatePredicate, effect:Effect, reduction:ReductionStep). The guard is a StatePredicate; if true, the effect is applied and the reduction advances to the target step."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/GuardedTransition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
