<https://uor.foundation/predicate/isExhaustive> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isExhaustive"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/isExhaustive> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True iff the disjunction of all dispatch predicates is a tautology over the input class."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
