<https://uor.foundation/predicate/isMutuallyExclusive> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/isMutuallyExclusive> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isMutuallyExclusive"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/isMutuallyExclusive> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True iff no two dispatch predicates can be simultaneously true for any input."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/isMutuallyExclusive> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/predicate/DispatchTable> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/isMutuallyExclusive> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
