<https://uor.foundation/predicate/never> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "never"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/never> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "False on every Datum. Disabled-arm marker."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
