<https://uor.foundation/predicate/contradictionReached> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True iff the resolver has entered a ContradictionBoundary."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/contradictionReached> <https://uor.foundation/predicate/evaluatesOver> <https://uor.foundation/state/ContradictionBoundary> .
