<https://uor.foundation/predicate/Is2SatShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://uor.foundation/predicate/TypePredicate> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/Is2SatShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is2SatShape"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/Is2SatShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True on ConstrainedType instances whose constraint nerve contains only disjunctions of width ≤ 2."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/predicate/Is2SatShape> <https://uor.foundation/predicate/evaluatesOver> <https://uor.foundation/type/ConstrainedType> .
