<https://uor.foundation/predicate/inhabitance_rule_residual> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dispatch rule 3 (catch-all) of InhabitanceDispatchTable: IsResidualFragment → ResidualVerdictResolver at priority 2. Ensures total coverage."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
