<https://uor.foundation/stream/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://uor.foundation/stream/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UOR Productive Streams"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
