<https://uor.foundation/stream/ProductiveStream> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An unbounded sequence of reduction epochs where each epoch terminates and produces a well-typed output. The coinductive dual of a finite computation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/stream/ProductiveStream> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
