<https://uor.foundation/stream/StreamPrefix> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A finite prefix of a productive stream: the first k epochs and their outputs. Every finite prefix is computable in finite time."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/stream/StreamPrefix> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
