<https://uor.foundation/stream/StreamMorphism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A transform between productive streams: maps each epoch of the source to an epoch of the target while preserving the productive property."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/stream/StreamMorphism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/morphism/Transform> .
<https://uor.foundation/stream/Unfold> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
