<https://uor.foundation/stream/Unfold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The coinductive constructor: given an initial context and a step function (a morphism:ComputationDatum), produces a ProductiveStream. The step function must be certified to always reach reduction convergence."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/stream/Unfold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
