<https://uor.foundation/failure/LiftObstructionFailure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/failure/FailureReason> .
<https://uor.foundation/failure/PartialComputation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
