<https://uor.foundation/failure/TotalComputation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A computation where the FailureReason type is empty — failure is structurally impossible."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/failure/TotalComputation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/failure/PartialComputation> .
<https://uor.foundation/failure/Recovery> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/failure/Recovery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Recovery"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/failure/Recovery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A strategy for converting a Failure into a Success by modifying the computation path."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/failure/Recovery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/failure/FailurePropagation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/failure/FailurePropagation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "FailurePropagation"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
