<https://uor.foundation/failure/resultDatum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/failure/Success> .
<https://uor.foundation/failure/resultDatum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/schema/Datum> .
