<https://uor.foundation/failure/isTotal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True iff the computation is a TotalComputation (no possible failure path)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/failure/isTotal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/failure/PartialComputation> .
