<https://uor.foundation/linear/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UOR Linear Resources"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Linear discipline on site consumption. Formalizes that each site in a complete resolution path is targeted by exactly one effect."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/> <https://uor.foundation/space> "kernel"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/op/> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/effect/> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/partition/> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/type/> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/state/> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://uor.foundation/trace/> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearSite> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LinearSite"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A site index annotated with a linearity constraint: must be pinned exactly once in any complete resolution path."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearEffect> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LinearEffect"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A PinningEffect that consumes its target LinearSite. After application, the site is no longer available for pinning by any subsequent effect."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/effect/PinningEffect> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearTrace> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearTrace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LinearTrace"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearTrace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A computation trace where every site in the budget is targeted by exactly one LinearEffect."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearTrace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/trace/ComputationTrace> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearBudget> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearBudget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LinearBudget"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearBudget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The multiset of LinearSites available at a given point in resolution. Starts as the full site budget; each LinearEffect removes exactly one element."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LinearBudget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LeaseAllocation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LeaseAllocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LeaseAllocation"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LeaseAllocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A binding between a state:ContextLease and a subset of LinearSites. Formalizes what resources a lease claims."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/LeaseAllocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/AffineSite> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/AffineSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AffineSite"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/AffineSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A site that may be pinned at most once (but need not be pinned). Relaxation of LinearSite for incomplete resolution paths."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/AffineSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://uor.foundation/partition/SiteIndex> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/linearTarget> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/linear/linearTarget> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
