<https://uor.foundation/recursion/recursiveCase> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/recursion/recursiveCase> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/recursion/recursiveCase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "recursiveCase"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/recursion/recursiveCase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The recursive case match arm."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/recursion/recursiveCase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/recursion/BoundedRecursion> .
<https://uor.foundation/recursion/recursiveCase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/recursion/RecursiveCase> .
<https://uor.foundation/recursion/stepDecomposition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://uor.foundation/recursion/stepDecomposition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
