<https://uor.foundation/recursion/stepDecomposition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://uor.foundation/recursion/RecursiveStep> .
<https://uor.foundation/recursion/stepDecomposition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://uor.foundation/morphism/Transform> .
