<https://uor.foundation/conformance/GroundingDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Builder for GroundingShape. Collects source type, ring mapping, and invertibility contract."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/conformance/GroundingDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/conformance/DispatchDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
