<https://uor.foundation/conformance/StreamDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Builder for StreamShape. Collects unfold seed, step term, and productivity witness."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://uor.foundation/conformance/StreamDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://uor.foundation/conformance/PredicateDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://uor.foundation/conformance/PredicateDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PredicateDeclaration"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
